   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Comic Bonk\n\nA cartoon mallet bonks your mascot: it squashes, springs back, a BONK! burst and circling stars, with a timed bonk and boing. A 3-second loop. Mascots, toys and cartoons only: real people and pets are refused.\n\nFreeField preset `comic-bonk`. Runs on an 8 GB GPU. Open weights only.\n\n## Fill in\n- A photo of a mascot, plush toy or cartoon character: the node **Your mascot, toy or cartoon (3:4)**\n- Impact word (optional, default BONK!): typed in the FreeField app (`--caption` on the command line)\n\n## Stages, left to right\n- 1\\. Your photo (a mascot, toy or cartoon)\n- 2\\. Cut out the mascot (BiRefNet)\n- FLUX.2 klein 4B\n- 3\\. Clear the background behind it (klein)\n\n## Models\n- `flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors`\n- `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors`\n- `flux2-vae.safetensors`\n\n## What happens\nThis graph makes the cut-out and the clean background. FreeField's `freefield/comic_bonk.py` then animates the mallet bonk, the squash and recoil, the BONK! burst and the sound.\n\n## Run it\n1. Pick your file in the input node above and press Run.\n\nOr run the whole effect in FreeField: `python -m freefield run comic-bonk --photo me.jpg`\n\nLicense: BiRefNet (MIT) cut-out and FLUX.2 klein 4B (Apache-2.0) clean plate; the mallet is a FreeField asset generated with klein; motion, lettering and sound are made by FreeField\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "# Comic Bonk\n\nA cartoon mallet bonks your mascot: it squashes, springs back, a BONK! burst and circling stars, with a timed bonk and boing. A 3-second loop. Mascots, toys and cartoons only: real people and pets are refused.\n\nFreeField preset `comic-bonk`. Runs on an 8 GB GPU. Open weights only.\n\n## Fill in\n- A photo of a mascot, plush toy or cartoon character: the node **Your mascot, toy or cartoon (3:4)**\n- Impact word (optional, default BONK!): typed in the FreeField app (`--caption` on the command line)\n\n## Stages, left to right\n- 1\\. Your photo (a mascot, toy or cartoon)\n- 2\\. Cut out the mascot (BiRefNet)\n- FLUX.2 klein 4B\n- 3\\. Clear the background behind it (klein)\n\n## Models\n- `flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors`\n- `qwen_3_4b_fp8_mixed.safetensors`\n- `flux2-vae.safetensors`\n\n## What happens\nThis graph makes the cut-out and the clean background. FreeField's `freefield/comic_bonk.py` then animates the mallet bonk, the squash and recoil, the BONK! burst and the sound.\n\n## Run it\n1. Pick your file in the input node above and press Run.\n\nOr run the whole effect in FreeField: `python -m freefield run comic-bonk --photo me.jpg`\n\nLicense: BiRefNet (MIT) cut-out and FLUX.2 klein 4B (Apache-2.0) clean plate; the mallet is a FreeField asset generated with klein; motion, lettering and sound are made by FreeField\n"
   },
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
